---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Returns and Replacements | The Royal House of Engagement" description="What happens if your Low Value Content shirt arrives damaged, misprinted, or wrong.">
  <article class="plain-page">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Draft · November 23, 2026</p><h1>Returns and replacements.</h1><p>Shirts are made to order, so the rules are simple and fair.</p></header>
    <div class="rows">
    <section><h2>Misprints, damage and wrong items</h2><p>If your shirt arrives damaged, misprinted, or is not the item, size or color you ordered, we will send a free replacement or refund you in full. Write to <a href="mailto:support@lowvaluecontent.com">support@lowvaluecontent.com</a> within 30 days of delivery with your order link and a photo of the problem.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Fit and change of mind</h2><p>Because each shirt is printed for you, we cannot accept returns for fit or change of mind, and shipping is not refunded in that case. Please check the size guidance on the product page before ordering.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Lost packages</h2><p>If tracking shows your order delivered but you did not receive it, or it never arrives, contact us and we will work it out with the carrier and our print partner.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Refunds</h2><p>Approved refunds go back to your original payment method. Your bank sets how long they take to appear.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
